    "created_at": "2021-08-03T13:59:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-08-03T13:59:26Z",
    "body": "I'm leaning toward using \"implements\" in the DOM Standard, but I see there is still the slight problem of it only being defined for ECMAScript values, not IDL objects. I think I'll ignore that issue for now though and assume we'll eventually make it work for either (or allow them to be magically swapped as needed).",
